  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside, it is like late night: the sky is pitch black and filled with stars, and dazzling starlight shines on the ground. The terrain is like a giant basin, with upward sloping ground at the center and continuous mountain ranges at the edge forming a circular wall. Star fragment grass grows on black muddy ground.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and Hei Lou Lan pass a square starlight door with a plaque reading Star Form Blessed Land into a pitch-black sky full of stars over a giant basin whose center rises while mountain ranges ring the rim like a circular wall. Star fragment grass grows on black mud in better condition than the same grass Fang Yuan planted in Hu Immortal blessed land, which he credits to star path affinity for related plants. Three injured spinefin star dragonfish follow the night sky, and battle damage marks grass, fish, and mountains.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A jade-like boy land spirit, Star Form Child, is Star Lord Wan Xiang’s lingering obsession assimilated with the blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ownership-condition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_form_child",
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The spirit says the main body died in the eighth star hall after Song Zi Xing left hidden injuries to body and soul.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ownership-condition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_zi_xing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To become owner, a challenger must bring Song Zi Xing’s head. External Gu Immortals may stay no more than seven minutes; only the master may help pass tribulation, and an earthly calamity is already near. Fang Yuan and Hei Lou Lan leave; the entrance vanishes behind them, and while the door stays closed the blessed land stays hidden.",
      "chapters": [
        729
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ownership-condition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan places Luo Po valley in Star Form blessed land after obtaining it. Putting Luo Po valley inside Hu Immortal blessed land is not wise, since Hei Lou Lan often goes there to refine airsac Gu with the hairy men using strength qi Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        992
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luo-po-valley",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_luo_po_valley",
        "gu_airsac_gu",
        "gu_strength_qi_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later leaves Hu Immortal blessed land and moves to Star Form blessed land to enter the valley. Shadow Sect had modified Luo Po valley into a different state, but at Fang Yuan’s request Tai Bai Yun Sheng restores its original environment before Fang Yuan sends his soul inside it.",
      "chapters": [
        997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luo-po-valley",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan had obtained many strength path immortal zombie corpses from Blazing Heaven Demoness as a failsafe for the life-and-death immortal aperture. These bodies were all placed in Star Form blessed land, and after Yi Tian Mountain he got them back from Lang Ya land spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        1073
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "strength-path-zombie-bodies-stored",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    }
  ],
